# SDL10 sim-log event catalogue + redundancy pass

## Context

Every currently-emitted sim-log event kind, listed and described in detail, as of SDL10 (the
format last touched in the session that added `BlockPushed.reserved2` payload, head/retract arm
coverage, `SEF_QUEUE_DEDUPED`, and positions on kinds 5-8 — the changes that made the log
resume-complete, not just replay-complete). Includes a redundancy pass on top.

All counts below are measured from decoded `.simlog` output over the 9-fixture corpus
(`observer drop test`, `simple_observer_engine`, `simple_caterpillar`, `simple_no_sticky_loop`,
`movableRCA`, `submarine`, `tank`, `complex_machine`, `1-wide with rails`) —
**1,533,936 events, 147.3 MB.**

